**Summary:** Round 10 reviewed and commented on 49 draft PRs (#1196 to #1244) by reading the code only: 20 MERGE, 28 MERGE-WITH-FIXES, 1 REJECT (#1219, replaced by #1242). There is one HIGH: #1225 still writes the drawing name and folder paths into fault reports. It also found a guardrail 8 breach outside any PR: Structural's start-up sets MENUBAR without checking (`CuiMenuGeneratorService.cs`, about line 1421). No PR in this round adds a transaction, view change, system-variable write or command to an automatic path, and no blue was found. The lists are C-38 (12 plain MERGE plus a waiting-for-fixes order) and S-38 (8 plain MERGE, four of them after the PRs they are stacked on, and 6 waiting for fixes). They have not been trial-merged against the earlier train lists.
